  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You and any allied fiend or undead within your Aura of Protection gain a bonus to damage rolls equal to your Charisma modifier when making a melee attack. A creature can benefit from this feature from only one paladin at a time.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-aura-of-hate\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>This feature includes a passive effect applying the bonus damage to the Paladin's melee attacks, and an activity to grant the bonus to allied fiends and undead within the aura.</p></section>",
